  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 984c5de76c5166a4e84eac2b8540123c, type: 2}
  textLines:
  - If this takes longer than a pint, I'm busy.
  - Joe took me tools again, I swear, I'll bury that bastard!
  - Ah, good to see you, old fen. What can I get ye?
  - Long time no see, my old fen. I hope you are doing well. What can I do for you?
